  "contentHtml": "\n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>New Delhi: <a href=\"/tag/rajiv+gandhi+cancer+institute\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Rajiv Gandhi Cancer Institute</a> &amp; Research Centre (RGCIRC) has named Dr. <a href=\"/tag/vineet+talwar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Vineet Talwar</a> as its Medical Director effective September 1, 2026.Dr. Talwar is a senior medical oncologist with more than two decades of association with RGCIRC, the research institute said.He has been serving as Director of <a href=\"/tag/medical+oncology\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Medical Oncology</a> at RGCIRC and has been associated with the Department of Medical <a href=\"/tag/oncology\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Oncology</a> since May 2000.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>According to RGCIRC, Dr. Talwar brings extensive clinical, academic and research experience to the role.“In his new role as medical director, Dr. Talwar will work closely with RGCIRC’s leadership and clinical teams to further strengthen multidisciplinary cancer care, quality standards, academic programmes and research initiatives across the institute,” the institute said.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                             